{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Prologue version of &quot;Express\u00a0<i>Car Wash Simulator</i>&quot;, you can experience the core gameplay mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wash, foam and relax. Feel the satisfying experience.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> START WASHING!  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy and intuitive mechanics </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Jump to the action straight away-\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wash cars with various colored soaps.. Feast for the eyes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156530/extras/car-wash-simulator-washing-mechanic-main.gif?t=1745320604\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect cards and welcome new customers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From small sedans to large SUVs and even trucks, wash a wide range of cars and earn money for each one you clean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156530/extras/express-car-wash-simulator-cardCollection.gif?t=1745320604\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wash cars with Colored Soaps !\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the satisfying sight of vibrant, colorful foam!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156530/extras/express-car-wash-simulator-colored-wash-car-wash.gif?t=1745320604\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156530/extras/express-car-wash-simulator-soapMachine.gif?t=1745